      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you document the source of these?  For instance:\n```\n/* Right-ALT - scan code set 2 0xE011 */\n```\n\nAlso what about CONFIG_KEYBOARD_CUSTOMIZATION?  Glancing through boards with this option, I see at least one where the search key moved.\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/board/omnigul/keyboard_customization.c;l\u003d16\n\nYou could create additional CONFIG options such as `CONFIG_ALT_R_COL`, or you could do a run-time lookup at initialization to determine the correct row/col.\n\nIf you go the CONFIG option route, you should add a build-time check.\n```\nBUILD_ASSERT(scancode_set2[CONFIG_ALT_R_COL][CONFIG_ALT_R_ROW] \u003d\u003d 0xe011)\n```",
